://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114044","id":3693088224,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7cIA3g","user":{"login":"GoranKovac","id":19614757,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjE0NzU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19614757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac","html_url":"https://github.com/GoranKovac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-26T16:36:19Z","updated_at":"2025-12-26T16:44:25Z","body":"Same issue on `Hyprland` + mouse does not work at all in game view:\n\nDebugger just shows \n```\nE 0:00:00:974   fps_controller_NEW.gd:36 @ _ready(): Parameter \"pointed_win\" is null.\n  <C++ Source>  platform/linuxbsd/wayland/display_server_wayland.cpp:408 @ _mouse_update_mode()\n  <Stack Trace> fps_controller_NEW.gd:36 @ _ready()\n****\n```\n\npointing to this line in the script\n\n```\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tInput.mouse_mode = Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3693088224/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739928092","html_u