for `zwp_pointer_constraints_v1#10.lock_pointer` as the error happens in the following line. Here is also my full system info from the editor:\n\nGodot v4.6.beta3 - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on Wayland - Wayland display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated Intel(R) Iris(R) Xe Graphics (ADL GT2) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1260P (16 threads) - 62.30 GiB memory","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3739928092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3987093812","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114044#issuecomment-3987093812","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114044","id":3987093812,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7tpjk0","user":{"login":"GoranKovac","id":19614757,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjE0NzU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19614757?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac","html_url":"https://github.com/GoranKovac","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GoranKovac/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-02T21:46:29Z","u